WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:02.268
-Guys, a lot of people are
talking about

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.870
schools resuming
in-person learning soon,

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.605
and in fact, President Biden
said this week

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:08.574
that he's aiming for all schools
to reopen in the fall.

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:10.376
Now, there's a lot to know about
schools reopening,

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.278
but also a lot of misinformation
out there,

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.413
which means it's time for,

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:15.248
Fact vs. Fiction.
Here we go.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:17.217
♪♪

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:20.820
-♪ Fact vs. Fiction ♪

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.388
-Now, let's get started.

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.124
First up, fact -- many teachers

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.593
have an exciting new curriculum
planned.

00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:31.463
Guys...
-Come on.

00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:34.067
-That is a fact, guys.

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:37.803
Unbelievable.

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:39.339
[ Laughs ]

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.674
Fiction -- most of it will be
spent "unteaching"

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.010
what dad taught during
homeschool.

00:00:46.512 --> 00:00:49.482
Next up, fact -- if visitors
are permitted in schools,

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.983
they should wear a mask.

00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:53.386
Fiction -- if visitors
don't have a mask,

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:56.022
they'll have to wear
the mascot head.

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:57.090
That's not true.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.191
-That's not?
-No.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:59.325
-It's the fiction.

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.360
-Here's another fact --

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.894
many high schoolers will
be returning

00:01:01.894 --> 00:01:04.998
to school just in time for
graduation season.

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:06.765
Fiction -- they've all been
wearing robes

00:01:06.765 --> 00:01:08.367
for the past 14 months
anyway.

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:12.938
Well, that's --
That could be a fact.

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:15.475
Next up, we have fact --
it's unclear how many students

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.677
are currently being taught
virtually.

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.812
Fiction -- it's unclear how many
students are currently

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:21.414
playing Minecraft while
pretending to

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.350
be taught virtually.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.788
Next up, we have fact --
there are many students

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.757
who still aren't vaccinated.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.159
Fiction -- there are many
students whom

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.628
still aren't vaccinated.

00:01:39.331 --> 00:01:41.534
And finally, fact --
teachers should know

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.603
all the CDC guidelines.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.238
Also a fact -- the CDC
guidelines should include

00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:47.673
giving teachers
a million dollars

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:49.208
and a paid booze cruise

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:51.911
for everything they've done
this past year.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:55.115
That is all the time we have for
Fact vs. Fiction.

